        "created_at": "2025-08-04T15:10:35.318477+00:00",
        "notes": "For the first round, make sure to grab  [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) as this is the most important part of this build. It allows us to throw large quantities of orbs without having to wait ages for that pesky ability cooldown. You'll want to be spraying as much as possible to get orbs, only using Secondary Fire to restore energy or secure kills.\n\n [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) enables us to spend energy faster and therefore throw orbs faster. We'll also restore our energy faster when sucking and heal faster with the spray, which is good too.\n\n [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) boosts the healing from our orbs.\n\n [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) is a decent survivability boost. Moira is a fragile hero at 225 base health, so having that little bit of extra can make a lot of difference. The armour offers the best overall survivability, so that's what I went with here.",
