    {
        "id": "0f94fab0-1ada-4668-b853-4aa6aa6f2836",
        "build_id": "acfd437d-38fc-45e0-8df5-dc9e282bca73",
        "round_number": 3,
        "cash_earned": 0,
        "created_at": "2025-08-04T15:10:35.318477+00:00",
        "notes": "In most situations, you'll want to grab  [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb) to create extra orbs on cooldown. The alternative is  [Voidhoppers](item_d4ce0c76-2500-40d6-b066-dca303be097f) which trades some personal survivability for the utility of momentary invincibility and cleansing for your teammates. I generally only grab it if the enemy team has a Junker Queen, a particularly aggressive Ana, or an Ashe doing a burn build (and even then only sometimes).\n\n [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6) is a key item for this build. With it we can pretty much remove the limit on our biotic energy, since the cooldown for fade is about as long as it takes for us to spend our energy. You can now do away with using secondary fire entirely, though it may still help against a mobile hero on low health.\n\n [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be)  is exceptional for consistency, since it will (to some extent) maximise the value we get out of each orb.\n\nApart from those, I generally keep the starting three items, then maximise ability power from there. I'm generally on a budget though, so I can't get as much as you'd expect .",
